Bengaluru Traffic Advisory: Parking Arrangements
Parking will not be permitted near the main entrance of Halasuru Lake and Kalyani, or along Kensington Road, Annaswamy Modaliyar Road, and Tank Road.
Deputy Commissioner of Police (Traffic-East), Sahil Bagla, has appealed to citizens to follow diversions, avoid parking in restricted zones, and cooperate with police during the immersion days.
